    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Disclaimer:</strong> The base game includes <strong>Chapter One</strong>. Additional chapters will be available as <strong>DLC</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Forgotten Past</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Investigating in a forgotten factory. you uncover dark secrets, haunted machines, and a past that was never meant to be found, strange visions, and a truth that someone tried to bury. Just be careful, this place isn't abandoned </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You didn\u2019t come here for answers\u2026</i><br>Your friend called you for a reason</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831290/extras/68de2aeacff944ead4773a4c8c79c82f.poster.webp?t=1755781947\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831290/extras/68de2aeacff944ead4773a4c8c79c82f.webp?t=1755781947\" class=\"bb_img\" width=800 height=450 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After strange visions and a receiving a call from your friend, you arrive at a forgotten factory. <br>The place should be empty\u2026<br>But you're never alone</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>Voices, echo through the speakers. <br>Something is watching</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >you were never meant to find this place.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore and discover The Forgotten Past</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831290/extras/6153a557e57ae522c00263e148c2c15c.avif?t=1755781947\" width=2048 height=816 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a story-driven horror experience where atmosphere and tension are everything.<br>when something happens, it's for a reason. <br>And it always leads deeper.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GrappyGun!</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pull and move heavy objects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reach\u00a0places over gaps or height up</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve environmental puzzles</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831290/extras/30853bb9e264ca4b848eba3d574d653f.poster.webp?t=1755781947\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831290/extras/30853bb9e264ca4b848eba3d574d653f.webp?t=1755781947\" class=\"bb_img\" width=800 height=450 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What Happened Here?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden throughout the factory are old <strong>VHS tapes</strong> showing moments from before everything fell apart. <br>The machines. The testing. The thing they made.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also find Audio Logs,\u00a0paper nodes and lots of hidden secrets to be uncovered</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Disclaimer:</strong> The base game includes <strong>Chapter One</strong>. Additional chapters will be available as <strong>DLC</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Forgotten Past</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Investigating in a forgotten factory. you uncover dark secrets, haunted machines, and a past that was never meant to be found, strange visions, and a truth that someone tried to bury. Just be careful, this place isn't abandoned </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You didn\u2019t come here for answers\u2026</i><br>Your friend called you for a reason</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831290/extras/68de2aeacff944ead4773a4c8c79c82f.poster.webp?t=1755781947\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831290/extras/68de2aeacff944ead4773a4c8c79c82f.webp?t=1755781947\" class=\"bb_img\" width=800 height=450 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After strange visions and a receiving a call from your friend, you arrive at a forgotten factory. <br>The place should be empty\u2026<br>But you're never alone</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>Voices, echo through the speakers. <br>Something is watching</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >you were never meant to find this place.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore and discover The Forgotten Past</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831290/extras/6153a557e57ae522c00263e148c2c15c.avif?t=1755781947\" width=2048 height=816 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a story-driven horror experience where atmosphere and tension are everything.<br>when something happens, it's for a reason. <br>And it always leads deeper.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GrappyGun!</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pull and move heavy objects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reach\u00a0places over gaps or height up</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve environmental puzzles</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831290/extras/30853bb9e264ca4b848eba3d574d653f.poster.webp?t=1755781947\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831290/extras/30853bb9e264ca4b848eba3d574d653f.webp?t=1755781947\" class=\"bb_img\" width=800 height=450 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What Happened Here?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden throughout the factory are old <strong>VHS tapes</strong> showing moments from before everything fell apart. <br>The machines. The testing. The thing they made.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also find Audio Logs,\u00a0paper nodes and lots of hidden secrets to be uncovered</p>",
